  "description": "Dll for use by third party applications needing to access Paratext's data. Compatible with SIL.Lib 12.0.x (required). Backwards compatible with data from Paratext 8.0 and 9.x.\n\nNOTE: This version of ParatextData is built using a AnyCPU configuration, but certain projects will not open correctly when run as 32-bit because of dependencies on native 64-bit libraries.",
